{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51780","headline":"又口占一颂 · 慧棱","name":"又口占一颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万象之中独露身，惟人自肯乃相亲。\n昔时谬向途中觅，今日看来火里冰。\n（《全五代诗》八七引《槜李诗系》）（〖1〗见《槜李诗系》卷三十。\n二诗最早出处爲《景德传灯录》卷十八，又见《五灯会元》卷七。\n「擘觜」，二书作「擘口」；「相亲」，二书作「方亲」；「看来」，《景德传灯录》作「看如」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧棱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}